nt legislation. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate the data freely." and "© CNC/NRW. Data may be re-used under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence." The ArcGIS Online item states no licence.', 'landing_page': 'https://www.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=ee779c88755a4245a5600de869e99e0e', 'bbox': [-5.2208, 51.3934, -2.6695, 53.3405], 'geometry_type': 'point', 'concepts_hint': ['pollution-source', 'waste', 'uk-pollution-pack'], 'endpoints': [{'protocol': 'arcgis-featureserver', 'url': 'https://services.arcgis.com/hQoYDJEEJMaPw8Sy/arcgis/rest/services/Environmental_Permitting_Regulations___Waste_Sites/FeatureServer/0', 'service_url': 'https://services.arcgis.com/hQoYDJEEJMaPw8Sy/arcgis/rest/services/Environmental_Permitting_Regulations___Waste_Sites/FeatureServer', 'capabilities': ['query'], 'info': {'name_field': 'Site_name', 'code_field': 'Permit_number', 'class_field': 'Waste_activity', 'status_field': 'Operational_status', 'date_field': 'Issue_date', 'class_values': ['Operational', 'Closed', 'Pre-Operational'], 'nation': 'Wales', 'completeness': 'complete', 'completeness_note': "all of Wales; Natural Resources Wales's register of waste permits in force", 'data_date': '2023-12-28', 'data_date_source': 'layer editing info'}, 'check_url': 'https://services.arcgis.com/hQoYDJEEJMaPw8Sy/arcgis/rest/services/Environmental_Permitting_Regulations___Waste_Sites/FeatureServer/0/query?where=1%3D1&returnCountOnly=true&f=json'}, {'protocol': 'landing', 'url': 'https://www.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=ee779c88755a4245a5600de869e99e0e'}], '_ctx': {'publisher': 'Natural Resources Wales', 'publisher_type': 'public-body', 'country': 'GB', 'seed_catalog': 'curated:uk-pollution.yaml', 'discovered_via': 'curated'}}, {'kind': 'record', 'id': 'uk-daera-pollution-incidents-1km', 'title': 'Confirmed water pollution incidents per 1 km square, 2011-2024, Northern Ireland (DAERA)', 'publisher': 'Department of Agriculture, Environment and Rural Affairs (DAERA)', 'publisher_type': 'public-body', 'country': 'GB', 'abstract': "Number of confirmed pollution incidents in and around watercourses in each 1 km grid square of Northern Ireland, 2011 to 2024, each confirmed by NIEA's Emergency Pollution team. y2011...y2024 count incidents per year; totals is the sum; domestic, farm, industry, niw_ltd (NI Water), transport, other and no_info split them by source; catoil, catsewage, catchemical, catagriculture and the other cat* fields by type; low, medium and high by severity. Only squares with at least one incident are in the layer: a square that isn't there had none confirmed. Gridded on purpose, so it doesn't locate an incident to a site. Fields: code field gridsq, count field totals. 5,317 features. Completeness: complete (all of Northern Ireland; squares with no confirmed incident are left out). A curated record for UK contamination screening (Tobler, 24 Nov 2026): the publisher's own layer, checked to return features for a bounding box.", 'licence': 'Open Government Licence v3.0: "This public sector information is licensed under the terms of the Open Government Licence v3.0" (DAERA\'s ArcGIS Online item).', 'landing_page': 'https://opendata-daerani.hub.arcgis.com/datasets/DAERANI::pollution-incidents-2011-to-2024', 'bbox': [-8.1267, 54.0123, -5.3727, 55.3058], 'geometry_type': 'polygon', 'concepts_hint': ['pollution-source', 'water-quality', 'uk-pollution-pack'], 'endpoints': [{'protocol': 'arcgis-featureserver', 'url': 'https://services-eu1.arcgis.com/kswen6BYexuc1SUk/arcgis/rest/services/Pollution_Incidents_2011_to_2024/FeatureServer/0', 'service_url': 'https://services-eu1.arcgis.com/kswen6BYexuc1SUk/arcgis/rest/services/Pollution_Incidents_2011_to_2024/FeatureServer', 'capabilities': ['query'], 'info': {'code_field': 'gridsq', 'count_field': 'totals', 'severity_fields': 'low, medium, high', 'nation': 'Northern Ireland', 'completeness': 'complete', 'completeness_note': 'all of Northern Ireland; squares with no confirmed incident are left out',